  "prefLabel": "Pol 101.18 Effective date",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pol 101.18 \"Effective date\" means a date or dates on which action was taken by the appointing authority or council, as applicable, concerning the appointment, death, promotion, termination, certification, or revocation of certification of police or corrections officers.\n\nSource. #1534, eff 2-17-80; ss by #1988, eff 3-25-82; ss by #2783, eff 7-27-84; ss by #4437, eff 6-22-88; ss by #5836, eff 6-15-94; ss by #7301, eff 6-8-00",
